          <div class="lp-phase__copy lp-reveal">
            <p class="lp-phase__meta"><span class="lp-phase__n">Phase 04</span><span class="lp-status">Next</span></p>
            <h3 class="lp-h3">The first 100 printed card sets</h3>
            <p>
              A numbered pilot edition for PsyCare teams, drug-checking services and outreach workers.
              It tests readability in low light, durability, and whether people scan the QR codes.
            </p>
            <ul class="lp-facts">
              <li><Icon name="ph:hash-bold" aria-hidden="true" />Numbered 001–100</li>
              <li><Icon name="ph:ruler-bold" aria-hidden="true" />A6 · 105 × 148 mm</li>
