        <article class="lp-phase lp-phase--flip" id="phase-scale" style="--hue: var(--color-stimulant)">
          <div class="lp-phase__copy lp-reveal">
            <p class="lp-phase__meta"><span class="lp-phase__n">Phase 05</span><span class="lp-status">Planned</span></p>
            <h3 class="lp-h3">20,000 boxed sets that open up the “drugs” box</h3>
            <p>
              Most people keep a single mental box labelled “drugs”. This set opens it up: {substanceCount}{" "}
              cards sorted behind seven colour-coded dividers, so the difference between a stimulant, a
              psychedelic and an opioid shows at a glance, in effects, in risks and in what never to mix.
            </p>
            <p>
              After the pilot, 5,000 sets each in English, French, German and Italian, in a rigid box with
              a holographic print, for festivals, nightlife venues, drug-checking services and outreach
              teams.
            </p>
            <ul class="lp-facts">
              <li><Icon name="ph:package-bold" aria-hidden="true" />Rigid two-piece box</li>
              <li><Icon name="ph:sparkle-bold" aria-hidden="true" />Holographic foil lid</li>
              <li><Icon name="ph:tabs-bold" aria-hidden="true" />Seven category dividers</li>
              <li><Icon name="ph:translate-bold" aria-hidden="true" />4 × 5,000 sets</li>
